5. Contributions. If you send WatchLog a change to the Enterprise code, you allow WatchLog to
   use it under any licence, including this one.

6. No warranty. The Enterprise code is provided as it is, without warranty of any kind, to
   the extent the law allows. WatchLog is not liable for any damage arising from its use,
   except as the law requires or as a separate written agreement with you says.

7. Ending. This licence ends for you if you break it; you must then stop using the
   Enterprise code. A separate written agreement with WatchLog takes precedence over this
   text where the two differ.

